* ============================================================
* HPC Batch Queue System - GPSS cross-validation, manual-run version
* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Service distribution matches the Python DES: log-normal,
* mean = 2h, CV = 1.5.
*
* This GPSS World's LogNormal(stream,Locate,Scale,Shape) evaluates
* as Locate + exp(Scale + Shape*Z) -- Scale is mu ADDITIVELY, not
* exp(mu). Verified via hpc_lognormal_selftest.gps:
*   LogNormal(stream,0,0.103820,1.085659) -> mean ~2.0, CV ~1.5
* (mu=ln(2)-sigma^2/2=0.103820, sigma=sqrt(ln(1+1.5^2))=1.085659)
*
* RNG streams: 1 = arrivals + routing
*              2 = Short service
*              3 = Standard service
*              4 = Long service
*
* EDIT THE GENERATE LINE BELOW to select lambda:
*   lambda=45 -> IAT 0.022222   SATURATED       (offered rho_Std ~ 1.13)
*   lambda=38 -> IAT 0.026316   HIGH-SUBCRIT.   (offered rho_Std ~ 0.95)  <- priority point
*   lambda=30 -> IAT 0.033333   MODERATE        (offered rho_Std ~ 0.75)
*
* RUN PROCEDURE (do this for each replication):
*   1. RMULT  s1,s2,s3,s4         <- four distinct seeds, e.g. 11,22,33,44
*   2. START  1,NP                 (runs to clock=500: warm-up timer fires)
*   3. SAVEVALUE SARR,0
*   4. SAVEVALUE SBLK,0
*   5. START  1,NP                 (runs to clock=4500: end timer fires;
*                                    collection window = 4000h)
*   6. Read off with SHOW commands (see bottom of this file)
*   7. To start the next replication: CLEAR, then go back to step 1
*      with a NEW set of seeds.
* ============================================================
           SIMULATE

SHORT_SRV  STORAGE  16
STD_SRV    STORAGE  64
LONG_SRV   STORAGE  32

           INITIAL  X$SARR,0
           INITIAL  X$SBLK,0

* ---- Arrival stream (Poisson lambda). EDIT IAT per scenario. ----
           GENERATE  (Exponential(1,0,0.026316))

* ---- Routing XOR gateway: weights [0.05, 0.80, 0.15] ----
* .842 is conditional on the 95% surviving the first branch (0.842*0.95=0.80)
           TRANSFER  .050,,SHORT_ENTER
           TRANSFER  .842,,STD_ENTER
           TRANSFER  ,LONG_ENTER

* ---- Short partition: c=16, N=50 (system capacity), FIFO ----
SHORT_ENTER TEST L   (Q$SH_WAIT+S$SHORT_SRV),50,SH_BLOCKED
           QUEUE     SH_WAIT
           ENTER     SHORT_SRV
           DEPART    SH_WAIT
           ADVANCE   (LogNormal(2,0,0.103820,1.085659))
           LEAVE     SHORT_SRV
           TERMINATE
SH_BLOCKED TERMINATE

* ---- Standard partition: c=64, N=200, FIFO. SARR/SBLK -> P_b ----
STD_ENTER  SAVEVALUE SARR+,1
           TEST L    (Q$STD_WAIT+S$STD_SRV),200,STD_BLK
           QUEUE     STD_WAIT
           ENTER     STD_SRV
           DEPART    STD_WAIT
           ADVANCE   (LogNormal(3,0,0.103820,1.085659))
           LEAVE     STD_SRV
           TERMINATE
STD_BLK    SAVEVALUE SBLK+,1
           TERMINATE

* ---- Long partition: c=32, N=100, FIFO ----
LONG_ENTER TEST L    (Q$LONG_WAIT+S$LONG_SRV),100,LONG_BLK
           QUEUE     LONG_WAIT
           ENTER     LONG_SRV
           DEPART    LONG_WAIT
           ADVANCE   (LogNormal(4,0,0.103820,1.085659))
           LEAVE     LONG_SRV
           TERMINATE
LONG_BLK   TERMINATE

* ---- Run-control timers (single-shot transactions) ----
* Fires once at clock=500 (end of warm-up)
           GENERATE  ,,500,1
           TERMINATE 1

* Fires once at clock=4500 (end of 4000h collection window)
           GENERATE  ,,4500,1
           TERMINATE 1

* ============================================================
* After step 5 above, read results with these SHOW commands
* (type into the Command/Journal window):
*
*   SHOW QT$SH_WAIT          -> W_q Short  (hours)
*   SHOW QT$STD_WAIT         -> W_q Standard
*   SHOW QT$LONG_WAIT        -> W_q Long
*   SHOW SR$SHORT_SRV/1000   -> rho Short
*   SHOW SR$STD_SRV/1000     -> rho Standard
*   SHOW SR$LONG_SRV/1000    -> rho Long
*   SHOW X$SBLK/X$SARR       -> P_b Standard
*
* If SHOW won't evaluate an expression directly in your version,
* read the raw SR$.../X$... values and do the division yourself.
* ============================================================
